&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will build and improve the WebCompat team’s internal tooling, the dashboards and the broken-site-report screenshot pipeline the team relies on to triage and prioritize site breakage. This is a focused tooling role that makes the WebCompat program faster and more data-driven.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build and improve WebCompat dashboards (triage, reporting, and metrics).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improve the broken-site-report screenshot capture and pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with the WebCompat team (including QA) to turn reporting and triage needs into reliable tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid web development (JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Python &amp;amp; Django) and experience building dashboards / data views.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort with tooling, automation, and web services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Self-directed, with good written communication.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with WebCompat workflows and Bugzilla.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with screenshot / automation pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with Machine Learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help the Firefox DOM Core team improve the health of the Session History area. You will write tests to improve the coverage; you will fix tests and/or problems to improve the Gecko correctness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write Web-Platform tests to improve the coverage, and Gecko mochitests as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fix the problems and pass the tests to improve the Gecko correctness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work through code review with the relevant Gecko module owners and iterate to landing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Definition of done&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improved Session History test coverage and code correctness in Gecko, measured by passed test cases, allowing the team’s senior engineers to focus on security, performance and strategic projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in a browser-engine codebase or in automating for a browser-engine, ideally Firefox/Gecko.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid Javascript and applying that language skill to write automated tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in and experience developing software in C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong debugging skills in a mature larget codebase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort working in the open: public bugs, code review, and upstream landing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior contributions to Gecko or another major browser engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with web standards and Web Platform Tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allow us to introduce ourselves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello there! We’re Appinio, a global market research company that combines an AI-powered insights platform with expert consultancy. On a mission to make the world a little more fact-based, we help companies understand how consumers think and make smarter decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started out in Hamburg back in 2014, but we’re now humbled to call the world our playground, with over &lt;strong&gt;260 employees&lt;/strong&gt; spread across &lt;strong&gt;13 countries &lt;/strong&gt;(we’re remote-first), 2600+ international clients, delivering research from &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;+190 markets,&lt;/strong&gt; globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to be a part of the Appinio movement? &lt;strong&gt;🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Here at Appinio, we value &lt;strong&gt;transparency&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;in our recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;ve created a blog to share what to expect during each step of our journey together:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission as a Senior Product Manager:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a proven, disciplined Senior Product Manager who has mastered the core crafts of product management—discovery, structured strategy, rigorous execution, and outcome-driven roadmap delivery within a B2B SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the bridge between advanced machine learning systems and real-world customer value. You’ll partner closely with our engineering team and Engineering Leads to build our core AI architecture and harness, as well as AI-enabled user-facing features that keep Appinio ahead of the curve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft and execute our AI strategy by shaping the end-to-end vision, value proposition, and roadmap for flagship AI initiatives, balancing long-term technical foundations with high-impact customer features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive complete end-to-end product ownership, taking features from initial strategy and discovery through to architecture, execution, iteration, and measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale our internal AI harness through direct partnership with your cross functional engineering squad and their Lead to establish robust evaluation frameworks, LLM orchestration, model routing, and prompt engineering infrastructure that keep our systems reliable, scalable, and cost-effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practice rigorous product craft through deep user discovery, clear and actionable PRDs, tracking and tight success metrics (OKRs), and disciplined execution driven by rapid experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate team AI and PM fluency by leading as an AI-native PM, mentoring cross-functional team members, and fostering a culture of continuous learning, data fluency, and high performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring essential B2B SaaS experience with a proven track record of owning platform products end-to-end, alongside a deep understanding of multi-tenant workflows, complex user personas, and scaling software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess battle-tested PM fundamentals, backed by several years of experience as a Product Manager with demonstrated mastery in core PM frameworks, quantitative/qualitative research, and outcome-based execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a hands-on AI/ML track record, including direct experience working with AI engineers/teams to bring non-deterministic software, LLM applications, or agentic frameworks into production. Experience with LLM-as-a-judge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You maintain a strong technical and strategic balance, able to speak the language of engineering (RAG, vector databases, model evals, API latency) while translating technical capabilities into measurable business impact (revenue, efficiency, retention).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate with precision. Complex AI tradeoffs become a clear recommendation, a decision, and a quality bar other squads can reuse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an interest and a passion in the products we are building at Appinio with the vision to create the coolest market-research product in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
